        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-30T21:55:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In practice, I don\u0027t think we ever have other accesses to alloc-\u003evma concurrent with the mmap (since mmap runs first), but I think you are right... this should probably be smp_mb() to prevent HW reordering. I think smp_mb() is also a compiler barrier so we can replace barrier() with smp_mb(). Arve, do you agree?",
      "parentUuid": "3fba7167_97908d49",
      "revId": "9e012b979ac0f6051e5b4ba855293c653476bcc4",
